  "rule": "A piece is public only when releasedAt is a date on or before today in Pacific/Honolulu and hold is false. Every other piece is left out of the build, so its pages and files return 404. Dates come only from the repo's own records (production/publication-register.json) or rn-selected-work data/sources-*.json. A piece with no verifiable date keeps releasedAt empty and hold true.",
